. This would make such a great student or teacher gift and is easy to crank out in 20 minutes or less, jig and all. Follow for more laser crafts and ideas."}, {"shortCode": "DbuCCC5R594", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbuCCC5R594/", "caption": "Stop buying cleaning products because they\u2019re trending.\n\nBuy the ones that actually make keeping up with your home easier.\n\nThese are the products I reach for every single week because they save me time, work better, and honestly make cleaning feel less overwhelming.\n\n\u2728 Comment CLEAN and I\u2019ll automatically send you my complete list of favorites.\n\nSave this for the next time you\u2019re ready to reset your home. \ud83e\uddfa\n\n#cleaning #cleaningmadeeasy #cleanwithme #tidyhouse #cleaningwin", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T00:45:05.000Z", "videoDuration": 15.566667, "videoPlayCount": 5152, "videoViewCount": 2593, "likesCount": 19, "commentsCount": 42, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-dus1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/764103050_18423504931178865_6520022025239956321_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzk1ODExMDA1OTE0NTY5OTE5MjE4NDIzNTA0OTI4MTc4ODY1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=ozgqXXGecaUQ7kNvwHjDq0t&_nc_oc=AdpfGW0zzKxAxOw7o6o4hRxVT0Sl4gSZl75bqCxfhwuPd0LNLJRlmVYvtpsHpbglm88&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-dus1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=wSNfcAXg_zx0ZfvTLz8NyQ&_nc_ss=72a8c&oh=00_AQE8aEIHt_HTC_E7B43QcOUxTB79_-zwL7l8MLycNrSmpg&oe=6A908F9F", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-dus1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNN3SrI2LnxBNMiv-FMYibeqf0KwGbjQxRWphWaP73KUv8skuhrjlJrkFBNtD7MvRaq7ejIri_7kHjV2UImMh0eZ5LR0sCLC1V8r1A.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-dus1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=qWcD7BwYqSEQ7kNvwEikX0A&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTA1NTY3NTM2MDMyNjMzNCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE3LCJ2aV91c2Vj